        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Unlock both daily hubs and repeat their limited daily quests across many resets to reach Ogri'la Exalted.\n\n1. Check Ogri'la reputation. Already Exalted characters can go to step 9. Otherwise fly to Ogri'la on the western Blade's Edge Mountains plateau. Enable Trivial Quests and speak directly to Chu'a'lor (28.8, 57.4); the old five-player Mog'dorg chain is not required to open these dailies.\n\n2. Take The Crystals (11025), gather 5 Apexis Shards from plateau creatures or shard formations, and return to Chu'a'lor. Gather extra shards for the subsequent activities, and eventually keep 10 unspent for the tabard. These are bag-item Apexis Shards (32569), not Draenor's Apexis Crystal currency.\n\n3. Complete An Apexis Relic (11058). At a small relic circle around 33.1, 51.4, insert a shard and watch the lights. After each demonstrated sequence finishes, click the same four pads in that order; repeat until the objective completes. Stand over one small circle and write its pad sequence as 1-4 if the colors are hard to follow. This opens The Relic's Emanation daily, with a longer sequence.\n\n4. Take Our Boy Wants To Be A Skyguard Ranger from Torkus (28.4, 57.5). Spend 10 shards at the Fel Crystalforge in Forge Camp: Wrath, around 32.9, 40.5, for ONE Unstable Flask of the Beast, then bring the flask back. Do not drink it or spend shards on extra flasks. Follow any remaining local one-time quests for additional reputation.\n\n5. Take The Skyguard Outpost from Chu'a'lor and visit Sky Commander Keller just north at 27.5, 52.6. Unlock Bombing Run with Sky Sergeant Vanderlip (27.5, 52.8), then Bomb Them Again!. While flying, use the supplied bombs on cannonball stacks in the forge camps and keep moving to evade flak.\n\n6. Also take Wrangle Some Aether Rays! from Skyguard Khatie at 28.0, 51.5. Use the quest rope on five plateau aether rays; high-level characters should try the rope before attacking so they do not accidentally one-shot their targets. Turn it in to unlock Wrangle More Aether Rays!.\n\n7. At Honored, speak to Kronk in Ogri'la (28.8, 57.8), complete Banish the Demons, then add Banish More Demons to the daily circuit. Open the portal with the supplied item and shard, bring demons close to it, then kill them in its range. Pull without damaging them first if your normal attack would kill them too far away.\n\n8. Repeat the daily circuit from BOTH camps until Exalted: The Relic's Emanation and, once unlocked, Banish More Demons in Ogri'la; Bomb Them Again! and Wrangle More Aether Rays! at the Skyguard Outpost. Turn each quest in and return after the daily reset. Doing only the ogre camp's quests misses two available reputation sources.\n\n9. Keep 10 Apexis Shards in your bags and visit Jho'nass at Ogri'la (28.0, 58.5). Buy Ogri'la Tabard and equip it. The shard cost is 10, not an Apexis Crystal, gold purchase or a stack consumed by a summoning monument.",
